<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-GONZALEZ OUT INJURED.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-GONZALEZ OUT INJURED.</headline>
<dateline>MONTBELIARD, France 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombian Chepe Gonzalez pulled out of the Tour de France on Thursday with a knee injury.</p>
<p>Gonzalez, a stage winner last year, withdrew about 20 km into the 175.5 km 18th leg from Colmar at the start of the day's first climb. He was hurt in a fall on Wednesday and was 63rd overall.</p>
</text>
